Note on dataset licenses
========================

The committed feature tables under data/intermediate/ are derived products of
publicly available raw datasets. The raw datasets remain subject to the
licenses of their original providers. See README.md "Datasets and Citations"
section for the authoritative dataset DOIs, original sources, and the license
of each source dataset:

  - Severson / MIT / Toyota Research Institute MATR (CC-BY-4.0)
  - HUST (terms in Ma et al. 2022)
  - Sandia National Laboratories battery archive (CC0 / public domain)
  - Luh / KIT RADAR dataset (CC-BY-4.0)

The derived 34-feature CSVs in this repository follow the most restrictive
clause among the source datasets that contribute to each table. For redistri-
bution beyond academic use, consult the original dataset providers.
